{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-marks-and-spencer-neon-candles-2512-0153","content_id":"b894a2b0-51b4-479e-adf4-7244a761f5fc","description":"Product Recall for Marks and Spencer Neon Candles presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e62070bb-24d5-4c4a-bcf1-69c0502c820f","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-15T16:56:24+00:00","id":"e62070bb-24d5-4c4a-bcf1-69c0502c820f","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-15T16:56:24+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69403db7adb5707d9f33d7d3/2512-0153-product-recall-marks-and-spencer-neon-candle.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Marks and Spencer Neon Candles</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as it may flare up while burning.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware - Candles</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Marks and Spencer</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Codes</td>\n      <td>(on packaging): 8050M, 8049M, 8066M, 9722M, 9730M, 9732M, and 8052M</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>120g neon candles sold in M&amp;S Fashion, Home and Beauty stores and online. For a full list of product names and codes please see Annex A in the attached PDF.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e62070bb-24d5-4c4a-bcf1-69c0502c820f\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69403db7adb5707d9f33d7d3/2512-0153-product-recall-marks-and-spencer-neon-candle.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The candles present a risk of fire as they may flare up while burning. If left unattended, the flare could ignite nearby objects and potentially cause a fire to spread throughout the room. </p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulation 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users.  </p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using the product immediately and return it to any M&amp;S store for a full refund.  </p>\n\n<p>Please visit <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://assets.digitalcontent.marksandspencer.app/image/upload/v1765374251/RECALLPOSTER-NEON_CANDLES.pdf\">Product Recalls - M&amp;S</a> for further information, or contact Customer Services via the M&amp;S website or on 0333 014 8555.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0153</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-15T16:56:51Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-15","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-15T16:56:51+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/c